WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.500
At 50% progress, the unbroken phrase wraps into four measured lines at width 220.

00:02.500 --> 00:05.000
Width 320 remeasures the phrase into three lines while keeping progress at 50%.

00:05.000 --> 00:06.500
Width 220 restores four lines at the same progress.

00:06.500 --> 00:09.000
Replay reveals the four narrow lines over 1.4 seconds.

00:09.000 --> 00:11.866
Replay reveals the three wide lines over 1.4 seconds. Recorded on iOS.
